  "html": "<p>Here are all the Two-Handed Mage weapons.<br/><br/>\n</p><p><small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"2\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Name\n</th><th>Handedness\n</th><th>Type\n</th><th>Speed\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Comment\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Bo_Staff.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Bo_Staff.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Bo_Staff.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Bo_Staff.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Bo_Staff\" title=\"Bo Staff\">Bo Staff</a>\n</td><td>Two-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Normal\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Claweye_Staff.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Claweye_Staff.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Claweye_Staff.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Claweye_Staff.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Claweye_Staff\" title=\"Claweye Staff\">Claweye Staff</a>\n</td><td>Two-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Normal\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Hooked_Staff.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Hooked_Staff.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Hooked_Staff.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Hooked_Staff.png\" width=\"64\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Hooked_Staff\" title=\"Hooked Staff\">Hooked Staff</a>\n</td><td>Two-handed\n</td><td>Crushing\n</td><td>Slothful\n</td><td>\u00a0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/2h-weapon-_Shaman_Staff.png\" title=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Shaman_Staff.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image: 2h-weapon-_Shama